      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for these. The Oakwood one is perfect, really hits that sense of class and stability. \n\nFor the East District one, I'm a little worried the \"vibrant street art\" and \"lively streets\" bit might come across like it's a bit too... unpolished? We want to attract the same level of elite buyer as the Oakwood estate. Can you rewrite the East District description focusing more on the prestige and the high-end lifestyle of the neighborhood, maybe emphasizing the exclusivity and the value of investing in such a rapidly changing area?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
